Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life, fighting for\Ntomorrow. Go catch what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life, run\Nlike a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong, believe\Nyou can achieve your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. I'll not stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can make my dream come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know what is\NSomething is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away. The great\Nend of the unknown rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.68,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.74,0:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so can you. Only wait out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We can let go together,\Nbaby, crawling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.10,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Party for tomorrow. Go\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Roaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your eyes that\NI want, but your weary ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, and you want more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shine like a star to be good, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just that you can't achieve your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Out of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.28,0:02:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when can you speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Always could.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.42,0:02:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.48,0:02:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,you've lied to your\Nbrother this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.38,0:02:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I never once indicated to\Nhim that I became mute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.72,0:02:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a crazy assumption\Nthe guy made on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.68,0:02:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being deceitful!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:02:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not correcting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.79,0:02:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.98,0:03:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the sound stopped. Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.16,0:03:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.02,0:03:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like people are talking,\Nbut I can't hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You were being loud, so\NI took a countermeasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.54,0:03:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't hear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like how you can't\Nhear a peep from outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.66,0:03:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I put up a soundproof wall to cover us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I ate the calm calm fruit\Nand became a silent man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.58,0:03:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You have Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.28,0:03:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all for a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.48,0:03:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.39,0:03:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You faked the accidents too, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.02,0:03:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a sharp cookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole klutz thing is an act.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.98,0:04:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You caught on fire again, you liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.84,0:04:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been clumsy my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.82,0:04:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.10,0:04:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There, you happy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean to tell me that's\Nthe only truth to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.32,0:04:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you hiding all this\Ncrap from your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.28,0:04:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.08,0:04:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But not by choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.68,0:04:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's gotta curb my\Nbrother Duffy's rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.34,0:04:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe we're related.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Our parents showed us\Nnothing but love, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.86,0:04:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But that monster has no humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.22,0:04:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.44,0:04:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, my boys are innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.44,0:04:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Director, how is it made of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you, please don't\Nharm my children anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.30,0:04:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:04:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get even.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.82,0:05:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.52,0:05:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.84,0:05:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You wretches!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.12,0:05:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't die today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.38,0:05:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear to survive whatever\Ntorment you throw at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.74,0:05:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember my words!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I look forward to the day that I hunt you\Ndown and murder every single one of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.12,0:05:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.76,0:05:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's innately wicked\Nnature knows no bounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The only people who have seen\Nthe full extent of his brutality
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,are the four executives, including\Nme and the first Corazon, Vergo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Vergo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,An extremely powerful individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.20,0:05:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, he's away from the\Nfamily on a secret operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But the details of that\Nare between him and Duffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.36,0:05:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy has nothing to do\Nwith you, so forget about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.46,0:05:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't turn into a\Nmonster like my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.46,0:06:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now scram, quickly. No\Nway! I'm not leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I want to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.38,0:06:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you possess the secret name of D.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.12,0:06:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're part of a fateful few.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Growing up, when children\Nmisbehaved, we were told,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.78,0:06:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,if you don't fall in line,\Nyou'll be eaten alive by D.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Every so often, another person with D in\Ntheir name would gain public attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd overhear the elderly\Nmaking passing comments like,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,D will surely bring a new storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.70,0:06:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You trying to say I'm a monster, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.34,0:06:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The details are still unknown, but\Nthat name survived for centuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and has been muttered\Nacross the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.56,0:06:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who fear the inheritors of\ND have given them another title.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.78,0:06:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sworn enemy of gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.86,0:07:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If celestial dragons are\Ngods in this analogy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the purpose of your people might\Nbe the destruction of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.90,0:07:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But look, this meaning of\Ndestruction is different than Dofis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.22,0:07:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a force that opposes\Nthe order of heaven itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you spouting this crap at me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I joined your dumb family for one purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,To kill people before I die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't assume I want to work for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.28,0:07:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I only answer to Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.56,0:07:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What would I want to leave for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.30,0:07:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna die in a year anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.76,0:07:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a cure out\Nthere somewhere. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so ready, you're out! Sucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.64,0:07:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo will be angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.10,0:07:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.80,0:07:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet he freaks out when\Nhe learns you can talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You damn brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:08:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm way stronger than two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.94,0:08:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You broke the blood law a second time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.24,0:08:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why were you moving your\Nmouths but not saying anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll buy you both ice cream\Nif you shut up about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.98,0:08:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.89,0:08:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take a 500-berry king-size cone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby Five, can you spot me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.34,0:08:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.76,0:08:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He really needs me for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.94,0:08:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.98,0:08:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.90,0:08:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have trusted that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.52,0:08:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I screwed up royally.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Corazon, we're about to set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy's on our tail again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.50,0:08:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Zuru's on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.66,0:08:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.32,0:08:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hasn't he said anything yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.62,0:09:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided not to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.22,0:09:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave it some thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And remembered that I owed you for\Nkeeping quiet back when I stabbed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.10,0:09:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd call that about even.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.74,0:09:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone seen Ham or Law? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.12,0:09:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I saw them board\Ntogether. They aren't here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.44,0:09:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We need the extra firepower\Nand can't find either of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And I looked everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.74,0:09:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Master found this\Nin Corazon's hammock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.22,0:09:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they took off together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.62,0:09:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.06,0:09:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Un-tie me right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.10,0:09:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pick up that transponder still!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Joe Flamingo, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll talk, just pick it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.08,0:09:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pick it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.14,0:10:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.76,0:10:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Joe Flamingo, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.88,0:10:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you calling up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come and rescue me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.58,0:10:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Rice crackers Cookies, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh brucinante.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.34,0:10:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, need some time off?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You run into trouble—it's\Na personal matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.32,0:10:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.36,0:10:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How are the little ones doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.34,0:10:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you can scare them off soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.64,0:10:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I think those three are staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.24,0:10:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.40,0:10:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,family is becoming infamous\Nnow—take extra caution!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.86,0:10:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,extra caution
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.50,0:10:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as you see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:11:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I wholeheartedly entrust this case to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.76,0:11:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep me updated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.14,0:11:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.05,0:11:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send you a detailed report.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.14,0:11:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Sengoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.26,0:11:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The officer who asked\Nfor reassignment is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.16,0:11:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, send him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.14,0:11:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You've had quite a successful first year\Nand have been turning a lot of heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.98,0:11:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You wish to transfer to G5, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.64,0:11:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What was your name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.28,0:11:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, FYI, there's half\Nan egg on your cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.42,0:11:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, name's Vergo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Who'd you call just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.18,0:11:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say report?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.16,0:11:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been hiding something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you working with the Navy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.20,0:11:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Got something against him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.62,0:11:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The government and their allies sicken me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:12:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I ain't no Marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.02,0:12:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.40,0:12:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't go to the hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.78,0:12:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're acting like every\Nother brat in the world, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.98,0:12:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go to every hospital if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find a cure for your sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.44,0:12:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how big this one is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.20,0:12:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet they can fix you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.72,0:12:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Get that kid out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.50,0:12:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't catch whitebeard disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.50,0:12:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there any medicine for it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Might I ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.34,0:12:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were you born?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.76,0:12:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm from Flevance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.18,0:12:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the White Town!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.26,0:12:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.17,0:12:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get sick! Get it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We need anticeptic gloves and a gas mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.80,0:12:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Call security and notify\Nthe government! Trotto!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.44,0:12:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.36,0:12:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.54,0:12:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm subhuman to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.64,0:12:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Please leave us alone, you white monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want your gross disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.02,0:13:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you bring that infected little\Ncreature into a hospital of all places?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.48,0:13:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you realize you're putting\Nhundreds of patients at risk?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.44,0:13:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.94,0:13:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A patient with white lead\Ndisease is loose in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.86,0:13:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What a dangerous freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.77,0:13:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All wards, prepare for sterilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.00,0:13:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget that hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.82,0:13:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm real sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.30,0:13:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope that didn't hit a\Nsore spot on you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.02,0:13:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to see a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.56,0:13:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not all doctors suck like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm positive we'll find a good\None at this next hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.76,0:13:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't force me to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He should be put down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.62,0:13:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a severe case of\Nthat white lead disease!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.18,0:13:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him away before he dooms us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.34,0:13:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.25,0:13:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got an emergency! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.50,0:13:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a flooded survivor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You were supposed to purge them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:14:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, all the people around\Nhere seem kind-hearted!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.78,0:14:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Take those filthy white\Nblotches away from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight hospitals have been hit as a boy\Nwith white lead disease terrorizes...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.52,0:14:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting sicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.24,0:14:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.98,0:14:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.70,0:14:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find the cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.04,0:14:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.50,0:14:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This next one will help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,White lead disease!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Put the hospital on lockdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.60,0:14:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This kiddo needs your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.02,0:14:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.82,0:14:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Corazon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.98,0:14:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been forcing this poor kid to relive
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:15:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,his horrible childhood\Nover and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not getting any better either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.52,0:15:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I wondered if it was the\NWill of D driving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't care about that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.58,0:15:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I just feel so sorry for this damn kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.90,0:15:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.46,0:15:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd hate to hear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.80,0:15:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but this blubbering idiot is trying\Neverything he can to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.60,0:15:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still a pain in the ass, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.98,0:15:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but hearing you talk about death—my
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.78,0:15:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,heart can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.96,0:15:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have stabbed me,\Nyou little shit! But?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.72,0:15:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.28,0:15:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't hurt at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.22,0:15:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the one who was\Nactually suffering back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.08,0:15:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to fix things for you, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.98,0:16:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Cora!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.34,0:16:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cora!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.80,0:16:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Breakfast is done!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.52,0:16:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that face for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.86,0:16:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that face for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.77,0:16:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You called me Cora?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.74,0:16:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You said that, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.42,0:16:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You want the food or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.98,0:16:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Cora's own. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.06,0:16:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.98,0:16:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.28,0:16:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already been six months\Nsince you took off on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is law still with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.48,0:16:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.74,0:17:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.28,0:17:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad both of you are all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you found a good doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.70,0:17:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's time you\Ncome back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.88,0:17:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We might be able to cure Law's disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.78,0:17:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I happen to find a lead\Non the op-op fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Some stupid pirates who don't know\Nwhat it's worth got their hands on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.14,0:17:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems the Navy caught wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.78,0:17:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,because now they're offering them a ton\Nof money and getting ready for trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.56,0:17:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As usual, the world government is\Npulling strings to get their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.76,0:17:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's risky, but we can steal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.42,0:17:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we have it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.20,0:17:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,due to the nature of its power,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only allow someone whose\Nloyalty I trust completely to eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.22,0:17:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And that would be you, Corazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.20,0:18:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, you can cure Law's disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.76,0:18:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.54,0:18:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I value your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.70,0:18:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy has been hounding us\Neverywhere we went quite consistently.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.48,0:18:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Saru, in particular,\Nalways seemed to find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.34,0:18:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the past six months,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.24,0:18:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,the Navy hasn't reared its\Nugly head around us even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.82,0:18:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll note, that's exactly\Nhow long Corazon's been gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.04,0:18:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You think your dear little brother has\Nbeen tipping off the Navy this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.68,0:18:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Could be a coincidence, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.96,0:18:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's certainly what I'm hoping.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.54,0:18:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to distrust him, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.74,0:18:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still family after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at your law.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget those stupid\Ndoctors—you're gonna make
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.76,0:18:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,it without them once\Nwe get the op op fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.10,0:18:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your white lead disease\Nwill be a thing of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.40,0:19:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the Devil Fruit? Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Lets you modify someone's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You can perform miracle operations\Nand cure any nasty diseases.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.84,0:19:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,diseases
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.28,0:19:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.40,0:19:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe in fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.24,0:19:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.15,0:19:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's a catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.58,0:19:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You need knowledge to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I know you're the\Nson of a brilliant doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.96,0:19:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,One who was trusted by\Nthe people of Flevins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.40,0:19:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But why does that matter now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.82,0:19:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.73,0:19:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It matters because you're\Ngoing to eat the fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.50,0:19:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.41,0:19:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't Flamingo said you were\Nsupposed to eat it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.32,0:19:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A person will die if he\Neats two devil fruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.18,0:19:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Duffy only said that because he doesn't\Nknow about my calm, calm fruit-ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.28,0:19:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're through with Duffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.30,0:19:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We aren't going back to the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.48,0:20:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That decision became clear to me\Nas my journey with you dragged on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.36,0:20:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,By now, I'm sure Duffy has\Nrealized that I'm a traitor
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.84,0:20:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.74,0:20:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,On this snail, he said you\Nshould eat the fruit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.20,0:20:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a secondary reason\Nbehind that decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.62,0:20:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.06,0:20:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it, Duffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.16,0:20:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to sacrifice myself\Nto give you eternal life!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.62,0:20:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I don't, I'm a traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.40,0:20:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But either way, I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.72,0:20:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, we'll get the jump on Dofi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.42,0:20:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll steal the Op-Op fruit\Nbefore anybody else can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.88,0:20:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll eat the fruit\Nand cure your illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.36,0:20:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're better, we can go\Ninto hiding somewhere together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.00,0:20:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.58,0:20:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get that fruit,\Nno matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.96,0:20:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Garlic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.50,0:21:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Rice crackers!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Cookies. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.36,0:21:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Rosanante, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.14,0:21:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.86,0:21:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Garp, could you step\Nout for a second? What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.70,0:21:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I just brought you snacks, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.56,0:21:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,At least offer me some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.22,0:21:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, Admiral Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.68,0:21:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is now a bad time to chat, Sengoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.52,0:21:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your own damn tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.98,0:21:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get out of here, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoo, shoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.75,0:21:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,well, I'm taking the rest of the snacks\Nwith me if that's how you're going to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.82,0:21:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, can I talk now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.98,0:21:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.40,0:21:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you were looking to make\Na trade for the op-op fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.32,0:21:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but how did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.78,0:21:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother caught wind of it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.48,0:21:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.39,0:21:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's top secret info.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.44,0:21:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's who you're talking to, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where can I find the pirates\Nyou're making the trade with?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.94,0:21:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.06,0:21:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're smart, they're\Nlaying low right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.88,0:22:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And what if I told you that Doflamingo was
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.40,0:22:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,going to steal the fruit\Nbefore you could buy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.18,0:22:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.88,0:22:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.28,0:22:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dizzy all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.10,0:22:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,When and where are you making the trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.90,0:22:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Three weeks from now at\NRubeck in the North Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.88,0:22:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Rubeck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.04,0:22:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll meet Dofie and his\Nfriends on Swallow Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.88,0:22:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They should be there three days\Nbefore the handoff happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.50,0:22:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where you'll be waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.18,0:22:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I imagine he won't want\Nto take any chances,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.68,0:22:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,so he'll likely bring the\Nentire family with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.50,0:22:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.44,0:22:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll plan an ambush at Swallow Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.84,0:22:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be the end of Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.08,0:22:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a chance to catch the whole Don\NQuixote family in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.24,0:22:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make sure you stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.52,0:22:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.34,0:22:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a list I'll\Nbe sending your way as
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.48,0:22:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,soon as I can of Dofie's\Nbusiness partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:22:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Big shots working behind the scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.18,0:23:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A bunch of dark little secrets\Nhiding there in the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.00,0:23:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue, I see, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.84,0:23:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta lick!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.40,0:23:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, law!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.31,0:23:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready to take off?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.96,0:23:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.08,0:23:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.82,0:23:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.96,0:23:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.78,0:23:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.69,0:23:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,When we finally have a real chance to\Nsave you, it hasn't been three years yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.04,0:23:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you had more time than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.94,0:23:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.32,0:23:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez, the fever's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.96,0:23:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.88,0:23:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctors are useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.04,0:23:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all up to me now to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.44,0:23:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do, Law?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.10,0:23:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a hint, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.46,0:23:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta pull through this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.68,0:23:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay alive for three more weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.80,0:23:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a chance to make this right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.66,0:23:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.57,0:23:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did a storm have to hit now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.08,0:23:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Couran.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.22,0:23:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.13,0:23:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Ra?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.68,0:24:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All those years, the government\Nknew that my people would die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.08,0:24:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but they kept making us take\Nup that white land to get rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.42,0:24:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of Lovitz and my family,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.24,0:24:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,the government?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.98,0:24:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.32,0:24:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.70,0:24:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you one of them working with the navy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.36,0:24:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a marine like the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.92,0:24:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.18,0:24:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I could never be a marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.34,0:24:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.34,0:24:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with you, law, but listen to me, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.78,0:24:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you and I run away\Nwith the up up fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.14,0:24:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll make enemies of everyone—doflamingo\Nthe navy and the world
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.52,0:24:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,government—and they'll chase us to\Nthe end of the world if they have to,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.18,0:24:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so if you want to live, be\Nprepared to fight for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.16,0:24:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Any update
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.86,0:25:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,on the location of those pirates, sengoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.56,0:25:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're hiding in a ghost town.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.82,0:25:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In this place called\Nminion island—it's right to
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.80,0:25:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the east of rubeck—where\Nthey're making the trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.62,0:25:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,they're making the trade
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.18,0:25:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like they have a hideout over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.40,0:25:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirate's name is Diaz Barrels.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.46,0:25:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That ring a bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.16,0:25:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's a former Navy officer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.08,0:25:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Good memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.64,0:25:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, our lookout ship is\Nmonitoring Minion Island as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.82,0:25:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything he said seems to check out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.90,0:25:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We have everything set up\Nat Swallow Island, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.84,0:25:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Near where you told Doflamingo\Nyou were gonna meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.40,0:25:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We brought two warships to deal with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.40,0:25:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ready for an Alto battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.86,0:25:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let Boa Hancock get her\Ngrubby fingers on the op-op fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.26,0:25:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.64,0:25:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.55,0:25:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.96,0:25:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.26,0:26:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.17,0:26:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,EA, where's my booze?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.48,0:26:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a refill!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.32,0:26:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.68,0:26:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All this money for one fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.08,0:26:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how much they offered us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.74,0:26:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Five billion berries, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.62,0:26:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bunch of suckers!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.54,0:26:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the government full of morons or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.80,0:26:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If we get that much money, we don't\Neven need to be pirates anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.96,0:26:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We can just stuff our faces and party!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.48,0:26:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that sounds good to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.28,0:26:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,From what I understand about this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.48,0:26:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,if a doctor gobbles it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.86,0:26:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,then he'll get the skills to be a\Nworld-famous surgeon like none other.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.80,0:26:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There was some legendary doctor\Nwho ate it some time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.74,0:26:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They say he could perform\Nmiracles with a scalpel,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.70,0:26:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,cure incurable diseases,\Nthat sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.64,0:27:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But what the hell do I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.80,0:27:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to be a surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.78,0:27:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Not when you're as rich as we're gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.00,0:27:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.24,0:27:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out. Law everything that's near
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.58,0:27:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,me won't make a peep after i do this calm
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.56,0:27:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The face.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.38,0:27:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, that stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.36,0:27:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.72,0:27:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't hear a thing, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.10,0:27:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.08,0:27:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that even good for?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.00,0:27:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's totally dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.26,0:27:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,BB-5's arms' power is way cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.68,0:27:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.90,0:27:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally wish I could do that stuff, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.94,0:28:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But when it comes to having a peaceful\Nnight's sleep, no one beats me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.70,0:28:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.28,0:28:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened? An earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.32,0:28:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.23,0:28:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't hear an explosion,\Nbut something blew up!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.20,0:28:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The coal pole's on fire! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.80,0:28:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Was there an explosion or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.10,0:28:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.26,0:28:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My treasure's running!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.88,0:28:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Put out the fire already!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.08,0:28:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.06,0:28:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We must be under attack somehow, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.54,0:28:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The lights just went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.12,0:28:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's all this glass\Ncoming from? The lamps!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.16,0:28:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They were all shattered!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.52,0:28:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody, light a candle, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.78,0:28:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.69,0:28:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't anybody have a light?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.42,0:29:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.92,0:29:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like I said I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.94,0:29:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to cure that\Ndisease of yours right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.18,0:29:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That freaked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.48,0:29:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.39,0:29:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.98,0:29:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.89,0:29:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy in a black coat just stole the\Nall-bought fruit and he was coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.50,0:29:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.12,0:29:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.78,0:30:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you've got it, Ruff.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.66,0:30:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait for me here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.40,0:30:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back, and I'll have\Nthe Arpuffroot with me too.
